== Semantic-kernel audit ==

The wave was compiled from epistemic primitives outward rather than written as twenty unrelated articles.

<pre>
Belief ─┐
        ├→ Knowledge
Evidence├→ Justification
        └→ Epistemic status
             ↑
        Uncertainty

Evidence → Empirical evidence
Evidence → Provenance → Verification
Verification ↔ Validation

Scientific method
 ├→ Empirical evidence
 ├→ Measurement → Accuracy and precision
 ├→ Scientific model → Explanation
 ├→ Falsifiability → Counterexample
 ├→ Reproducibility
 └→ Replication
</pre>

The audit confirms that downstream pages reuse upstream distinctions instead of redefining them independently.

