== Audit acceptance criteria ==

Wave 1 is ready to leave Phase 3 when:

# all 60 reader surfaces remain present;
# one concept = one Core semantic identity;
# all Core domains pass the controlled runtime vocabulary;
# Simple/Core/Technical definitions remain materially consistent;
# the public/project distinction remains explicit;
# reading-depth transport directories pass substrate auditing;
# deployment maps slash titles correctly;
# <code>validate_v2.py</code> passes;
# runtime-schema, substrate, deployment, workflow, and Main-space audits pass;
# staging builds the complete projection.

